  </div>

  <!-- Why it exists -->
  <div class="app-detail-story">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="app-detail-story-inner">
        <h2>Why I built it</h2>
        <p>My wife had been planning our meals in an app that had quietly stopped getting updates. It still worked, but it was showing its age, and each year it felt further from the phone it was running on.</p>
        <p>So I built the replacement. I wanted something that feels native on iOS, that you can open on a Tuesday night and use without thinking about it, and that I'll keep maintained for as long as we're cooking from it. Nearly every feature in Meal Plan started as something one of us wanted while standing in the kitchen.</p>
      </div>
